Package: com.vo1dek.passwipe
Name: PassWipe
Version: 2.6
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Adds a PassWipe pane to Settings, where a second wipe password is set, and performs an authenticated "Erase All Content and Settings" through SpringBoard. The Settings pane and the SpringBoard half are one dylib injected into both processes.
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Conflicts: com.vo1dek.wipecode, com.vo1dek.wipecode-sb, com.vo1dek.wipecode-pref
Replaces: com.vo1dek.wipecode, com.vo1dek.wipecode-sb, com.vo1dek.wipecode-pref
